---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
const schema={"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Oculivo","applicationCategory":"BusinessApplication","operatingSystem":"Web","url":"https://oculivo.com/","description":"The operating system for modern eye care."}
---
<Base>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
<main>
<section class="hero-dark home-hero">
  <div class="wrap home-grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow home-purple">One connected eye-care platform</span><h1>Run the entire practice from one connected system.</h1><p>Scheduling, patients, clinical workflows, optical, communications, billing, staff operations, website, SEO, and reporting—connected around the same patient and practice record.</p><div class="hero-actions left"><a class="btn-grad" href="https://taxrescrm.app/book?product=oculivo">Request a private demo&nbsp; →</a><a class="btn-outline" href="/website-seo/">Explore Oculivo</a></div></div>
    <aside class="home-panel"><span class="eyebrow">Oculivo Core Connect</span><h2>Practice-wide clarity.</h2><div><b>Appointments & scheduling</b><b>Patients & clinical workflows</b><b>Optical inventory & orders</b><b>Insurance, billing & payments</b><b>Unified communications</b><b>Team Chat & staff operations</b></div></aside>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section-light depth-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="depth-top"><span class="eyebrow">One connected platform</span><div class="depth-title"><h2>Purpose-built depth.<br/>Practice-wide clarity.</h2><p>Oculivo is built around the way eye-care practices actually operate, so each department gets the depth it needs without trapping the team in disconnected systems.</p></div></div><div class="depth-cards"><article class="depth-card"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Front desk + patient flow</h3><p>Scheduling, intake, communication, reminders, documents, and patient coordination stay connected.</p><small>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected to the complete patient record</small></article><article class="depth-card"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Clinical + optical</h3><p>Clinical records, provider workflows, optical inventory, orders, and fulfillment share the same patient context.</p><small>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected to the complete patient record</small></article><article class="depth-card"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Growth + operations</h3><p>Billing, reporting, communications, website, SEO, and staff operations connect to the work happening in the practice.</p><small>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected to the complete patient record</small></article></div></div></section>
<section class="founding-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="founding-card"><div><span class="eyebrow">Founding practice program</span><h2>Build the clearer future of eye care<br/>with us.</h2><p>Get a private walkthrough and help shape Oculivo around the workflows your practice actually uses.</p></div><a class="btn-white" href="https://taxrescrm.app/book?product=oculivo">Request your private demo&nbsp; →</a></div></div></section>
</main>
</Base>
<style>
.home-hero{padding:94px 0 96px;min-height:650px}.home-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:82px;align-items:center}.home-purple{color:#825cff}.home-hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,6.5vw,84px);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.058em;font-weight:500;margin:24px 0}.home-hero p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.72;color:#c6c2db;max-width:720px}.hero-actions.left{justify-content:flex-start}.home-panel{background:#251b63;border:1px solid #55489a;border-radius:26px;padding:38px;min-height:430px}.home-panel h2{font-size:36px;font-weight:500;margin:38px 0 30px}.home-panel>div{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.11);padding-top:24px;display:grid;gap:18px}.home-panel b{font-size:15px;color:#ddd9f0}@media(max-width:900px){.home-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>